We sit around the dining table.
Deepa brings hot appam and vegetable stew.
That curry has a good smell.
"Maya, please eat."
"I will serve," Deepa says.
She serves appam and stew on my plate.
"I think that you will like this," she says.
I eagerly taste the food.
The appam is very soft.
The stew is also very delicious.
"Deepa, this is wonderful!" I say.
"I think that this is the best stew I have eaten since coming to Kochi!"
Deepa laughs happily.
"I am happy to know that you liked it," Deepa says.
"I will make this for you again."
"I will definitely come again!" I say with a smile.
We eat food while talking.
This is an excellent dinner.
